# Cursor Rules for noNews Bookmarking App

## Project Overview
- **Type**: Bookmarking application with guest user support
- **Architecture**: Monolithic project with Firebase backend and React Native frontend
- **Backend**: Firebase Functions v2 (Node.js 22), Firestore, Authentication, Storage
- **Frontend**: React Native (iOS/Android cross-platform)
- **Language**: TypeScript (strict mode)
- **Key Feature**: Guest users limited to 5 bookmarks

---

## Project Structure

```
/
├── functions/              # Firebase Cloud Functions
│   ├── src/               # Function source code
│   ├── lib/               # Compiled JS (gitignored)
│   └── package.json       # Backend dependencies
├── src/                   # React Native app source
│   ├── components/        # Reusable UI components
│   ├── screens/           # Screen components
│   ├── navigation/        # Navigation setup
│   ├── services/          # API and Firebase services
│   ├── hooks/             # Custom React hooks
│   ├── contexts/          # React Context providers
│   ├── utils/             # Utility functions
│   ├── types/             # TypeScript type definitions
│   ├── assets/            # Images, fonts, etc.
│   └── config/            # Configuration files
├── firebase.json          # Firebase configuration
├── firestore.rules        # Firestore security rules
├── storage.rules          # Storage security rules
└── package.json           # Frontend dependencies
```

